  "body": "When clicking the link to `Explainer` on the [doc site](https://wicg.github.io/serial/) you get a 404. This is because `Explainer.md` isn't on the `gh-pages` branch and we are attempting to grab it from there. The two solutions are:\r\n1. Add it to the `gh-pages` branch\r\n2. Update the link to find it on branch `main`\r\n\r\nHappy to submit a PR to address this simple change depending on your preference - thanks!",
